
@startuml
title Passport Automation System - Statechart Diagram

[*] --> ApplicationStarted

state ApplicationStarted
state DetailsSubmitted
state UnderVerification
state CorrectionRequired
state Approved
state PassportIssued
state Rejected
state Cancelled

ApplicationStarted --> DetailsSubmitted : Submit application
DetailsSubmitted --> UnderVerification : Submit proofs

UnderVerification --> Approved : Details and proofs valid
UnderVerification --> CorrectionRequired : Missing or incorrect details
UnderVerification --> Rejected : Verification failed

CorrectionRequired --> DetailsSubmitted : Correct and resubmit
Approved --> PassportIssued : Issue passport

PassportIssued --> Cancelled : Authorized cancellation

Rejected --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
PassportIssued --> [*]

@enduml
